      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了支撑这位胆怯却仰望光辉目标的少女，\n闪耀系列赛的挑战就此拉开帷幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3506a3b588a0ff371d0a53d4f19a9b58b0499de51f38e00b7e24642225c5fa7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
