      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据她所说，高尚骏逸从小就是个\n认真踏实、会默默坚持练习的孩子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59bece5d4fd849edf6a44d5c99a4da5b0c4789baee8050c39453d77f18d9381a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
