    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dcce571effd848afe090f30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『日本德比』结束后的某一天——\n高尚骏逸偶然看见了在训练中落泪的北部玄驹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed91a3f87bf058967c1461a5d62c05610dafa9cc2daee7e143e459b244571e38",
