    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d234058f34c494cd91b554",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹一直憧憬着东海帝王，然而那个\n离憧憬对象最近的位置，却并不是自己，而是大鸣大放。",
      "source_fingerprint": "622d4605a149dc7a02420b683b07eab8bbed1f140d2a0fd534b1b63e8d5093a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
