    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916db585be046471203302bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再加上大鸣大放骨折受伤，更让她与憧憬对象\n的命运重叠起来，北部玄驹也因此大受打击。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16a4b50da2098474aae9e8d107c53dbef7e0202aaf12f4ce0916f8cdb3456c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
