      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为过于在意粉丝的目光而陷入不安的高尚骏逸，\n向闪耀表演毫无保留地倾诉了自己的烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea02cae7c83094cdd75fee14f76adf2d975884206e546ed47487a35652777276",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
