      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d739cdc79d6681708ce28e2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在交谈中，她渐渐回想起自己为何会憧憬\n成为“伟大赛马娘”。而这时，闪耀表演也向她\n坦白了自己即将移籍海外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be8fb9e67d481326cb1d0963345c8c88291f27334e0dae286fcd36325421478",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
