    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f02ee9a482d89a11ff0485",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸虽然震惊，但青梅竹马的决心已经\n坚定无比。为了继续追逐奔跑的梦想，她\n决定飞往澳大利亚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16b51ea0449ba5ef0bd4ef24b332211778161f6f0388444e9d63d1529ebbb689",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089403.json",
      "json_path": [
