      "uid": "zhcn:ee24be47b4d25f1cdd53024e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一直以来，正是不断忍痛前进的高尚骏逸，\n给予了她勇气。对闪耀表演而言，高尚骏逸\n本就是“伟大的赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "400dea85f9921eadd236c4930e4edcc2b84f4f58df2b27a7d912b3a8c640b940",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089403.json",
      "json_path": [
