      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——当高尚骏逸重新抬起头时，她的眼中已经\n不再迷惘。她想起了自己真正该追逐的目标，\n并开始为下一场『京都大赏典』展开训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abba643e28e44916a8f8886b93c228172a303376b1877af6733f6256e5cfa59a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
