      "source_text": "于是，高尚骏逸向构成自己心结根源的强击\n与极峰姐妹，提出了共同训练的请求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a8599f65711cf79bfe1a16bca9c3611c99e90619add951b5a1cd1327e684eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
